eady-written[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]file in the sase-e6 format is rewritten to the pre-sase-e6 format, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and no code anywhere in sase or sase-core knows the sase-e6 format [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]exists.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]revert_stored_prompt_duality.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/revert_stored_prompt_duality.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-f2[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-f2/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chat markdown returns to a single Prompt section[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chat[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chat: strip the sentinel-delimited XPrompt and rendered-prompt sections [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]out of the chat writer, drop the two keyword arguments from every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`save_chat_history` caller, remove the parser's strip pass, and delete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `chat_history.rendered_prompt_max_bytes` config field.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt archive publishes only the verbatim body[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]archive[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive: remove the appended rendered-prompt section and the xprompt [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link rewrite from prompt archive rendering and preparation, drop the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sentinel/fence/link-target checks and the legacy counter from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation, and restore the sidecar agents README template.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read surfaces and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chat, archive[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: revert the ACE Chats detail pane, the `sase chat show` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase agent prompts show` rendering selectors, and prompt search's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section stripping, then delete `chat_prompt_sections.py` and remove [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every documentation paragraph describing the two stored renderings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch-time provenance capture removal[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]provenance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chat, archive, surfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance: stop writing `xprompt_sources.json` at launch, reduce the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source-collection and hosted-URL modules to exactly the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]definition-resolution surface `sase xprompt show` calls, and delete the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record loading and link rewriting helpers that only the reverted stores [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]used.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust prompt_xprompt module removal[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after surfaces, provenance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: delete the `prompt_xprompt` module and its three PyO3 bindings [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the sibling Rust core repository while keeping the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`prompt_rewrite` helper the artifact rew